- Corn
	set {Contract.selected_item} = "corn"
- Carrot
	set {Contract.selected_item} = "carrot"
Merchant_Emisarry: How many crate can you do for the  {Contract.selected_item}?
- 1 Crate
	set {Contract.selected_crates} = 1.0
	set {Contract.total_fee} = {Contract.selected_crates} * {Contract.fee_per_crate}
	set {Contract.reward_amount} = {Contract.selected_crates} * {Contract.reward_per_crate}
- 2 Crate
	set {Contract.selected_crates} = 2.0
	set {Contract.total_fee} = {Contract.selected_crates} * {Contract.fee_per_crate}
	set {Contract.reward_amount} = {Contract.selected_crates} * {Contract.reward_per_crate}
- 3 Crate
	set {Contract.selected_crates} = 3.0
	set {Contract.total_fee} = {Contract.selected_crates} * {Contract.fee_per_crate}
	set {Contract.reward_amount} = {Contract.selected_crates} * {Contract.reward_per_crate}
Merchant_Emisarry: Your total fee is {Contract.total_fee}
Merchant_Emisarry: And your total earn is {Contract.reward_amount} Currency
Merchant_Emisarry: And how long we can get those crate?
- 2 Days
	Merchant_Emisarry: Item is {Contract.selected_item} and Crate are {Contract.selected_crates}
	[signal arg="start_contract:2"]
- 4 Days
	Merchant_Emisarry: Item is\: {Contract.selected_item} and Crate are {Contract.selected_crates}
	[signal arg="start_contract:4"]